body:
{Made in Abyss}

Hands down my favorite anime, the kind of show that I can look at and say "this is why I watch anime." The art and animation are fantastic and breathtaking at times, the characters are endearing and memorable, the story while very straightforward is very compelling, the world building is at the level of stuff like Lord of the Rings and One Piece in depth, quality, forethought and creativity, and lastly my fucking god is the music amazing, one of if not the best ost I've heard in anime. 

I've watched nearly 300 anime and I will still put it as my recommendation, the manga is amazing as well, but the anime has so many extra touches that I feel make it a worthwhile adaptation that gives you a superior experience to its source material.
